# INVWIN5.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with /COM1 on
# the test machine, which has no serial port: the status bar names the
# port, the port fails to open with INV's reason, and ENTER on the
# message box ends the program.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN5.SNP is its
# snapshot.
S NOPORT
K ENTER
S GONE
